    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeremia na Ilaghano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA oreghorieghe na Jeremia ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sikira malagho gha ilaghano iji, kuwighorie wandu wa Juda, na awo wikaiagha Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwizere huwu, Ini BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli naghamba, Mundu useghiwadiagha malagho gha ilaghano ijo, uwadwa ni njowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerewilaghirieghe weke ndeyo ilaghano ijo, ngelo nerewifunyagha isanga ja Misri, kufuma ijo iriwa ja modo, ngighamba, munisikire na kubonya malagho agho nimlaghiragha, mpate kuwuya wandu wapo na ini nikaie Mlungu onyu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nani nipate kujikatisha ighemi nerewighemieghe weke ndeyo, jewineka isanga jinorie, sa iji koni jiko idime.” Niko ngatumbulia, “Ndeikaie wokoni BWANA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao BWANA ukanizera, “Ghora agha malagho ghose mizinyi ya Juda, na chienyi ra Jerusalemu kughambe; Sikirenyi malagho gha iji ilaghano, mughibonye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia nerewiwonyereghe weke ndeyo kwa wumboa ngelo nerewifunyagha isanga ja Misri, ngiwiwonyera sena na sena hata idime iji, ngighamba, munisikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ndewerenisikireghe, hata kudegha madu ghawo kwapo, ela kula umu wawo oreghendieghe kwa kukua kwa ngolo rawo mbiwi. Kwa wundu ugho niko nerewiredieghe njowe kunughana na malagho ghose gha iji ilaghano nerewilaghirieghe wibonye, ela ndewerebonyereghe anduangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukanizera sena, “Koko kuleghasikira aghadi ya wandu wa Juda, na awo wikaiagha Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamerie kuwuria wuwiwi ghwa weke ndee wa kala, awo wereleghieghe kughisikira malagho ghapo; wamerie kuitasa milungu mizima, na kuidumikia. Wandu wa Israeli na wandu wa Juda wamerie kujichikanya ijo ilaghano japo nerejibonyereghe na weke ndee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo BWANA waghamba huwu, ‘Olenyi naawuyareda wuwiwi aighu yawo wisedimagha kughufufunuka; hata wikeduanikemia sichaawisikiria anduangi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wandu wa mizi ya Juda na awo wikaiagha Jerusalemu wichaghenda kuililia milungu iyo werekoghe wikiifukiria marumba ela ndeichaadima kuwikira ngelo ya wasi ghawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia milungu yenyu eewuya mingi kara kara na mizi enyu ee Juda, na madhabahu ghenyu mughiwikie ghemfusha waya gheeka mengi kara kara na chia ra Jerusalemu; mpate kumfukiria Baali marumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo, oho Jeremia, kusakewilombia hata kusakenivoya kwa wundu ghwa wandu awa; kwa kukaia sichaawisikira iji wakaniwanga ngelo wapatwa ni wasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Awandu wapo niwikunde weko na hachiki engia andenyi ya Hekalu yapo ingelo wabonya mawiwi? Welee, wiaghesha wichaghiria mawiwi ghisewipate kwa kufunya vizongona vingi va nyamandu? Wichaboilwa andenyi ya agho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo imu ini BWANA nerekuwangieghe irina ja ‘Mzeituni ghuko na malemba mawishi, na matunda ghiboie;’ ela nichaghuomera kwa kiremba kibaa sa modo, na mbashu rake richachika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ini BWANA wa majeshi, uo orekuwaeghe wamerie kughora mawiwi aighu yako, kwa wundu ghwa mawiwi ghibonyero ni wandu wa Israeli na wandu wa Juda; wikanivavira ngolo kwa kumfukiria Baali marumba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Njama mbiwi aighu ya irangi ja Jeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngalomba, “Ee BWANA wa majeshi, kutanyagha kwa hachi oho kuritimagha ngolo na nia ra wandu, nakulomba kunineke kuwona kukilipa kisasi chako aighu yawo, kwa kukaia irangi japo najisaghika kwako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo BWANA waghamba huwu aighu ya wandu wa Anathothi; awo wikunde kukubwagha waawuyaghamba, “Kusakeloda kwa irina ja BWANA dichekubwagha” - ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa wundu ugho BWANA wa majeshi waghora huwu, “Ola nichawikaba, na wandu wa irika wichabwaghwa kwa lufu, na wana wawo wa womi na wa waka wichabwaghwa ni njala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekuwadie hata ungi wawo uchaasigharika, kwa kukaia nichareda wuwiwi aighu ya Anathothi, nagho ni mwaka ghwawo ghokabwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
